64070000/reb10/highres/3/E4506303_40.jpg"],"remarks":"Welcome to this beautifully located home in the heart of Tamarack, perfectly situated in a quiet cul de sac just steps from a park and school, making it an ideal setting for family living. The inviting front deck sets the tone as you enter into a bright living room featuring fresh paint and a warm, welcoming feel. The white kitchen offers an abundance of storage with two pantries and overlooks the dining area, creating a functional and connected main living space. Convenient main floor laundry and a two piece bathroom complete this level. Upstairs you will find two spacious family bedrooms and a full bathroom, along with a generous primary suite that features a lovely ensuite with a large tub and a walk in closet. The fully landscaped yard is perfect for enjoying the outdoors with a deck and plenty of space, while the oversized garage offers the added bonus of mezzanine storage. This is a fantastic opportunity for families looking for comfort, functionality, and an unbeatable location. (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$449,900"],["Type","House"],["Bedrooms","3"],["Bathrooms","3"],["Half bathrooms","1"],["Living area","1,405 sq ft"],["Year built","2011"],["Storeys","2"],["Neighbourhood","Tamarack"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T6T0J6"],["MLS® number","E4506303"],["Listed","August 31, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Dishwasher, Stove, Dryer"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Basement","Unfinished, Full"],["Parking","Detached Garage, Oversize"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","3.88 m × 3.77 m (12'9\" × 12'4\")"],["Dining room","Main level","3.47 m × 3.00 m (11'5\" × 9'10\")"],["Kitchen","Main level","3.52 m × 3.91 m (11'7\" × 12'10\")"],["Primary Bedroom","Upper Level","3.21 m × 3.84 m (10'6\" × 12'7\")"],["Bedroom 2","Upper Level","2.81 m × 3.98 m (9'3\" × 13'1\")"],["Bedroom 3","Upper Level","2.85 m × 3.87 m (9'4\" × 12'8\")"]],"courtesy":"Christie Bergman, MaxWell Progressive","board